// 我的任務：甘特圖（C# TasksPage.Gantt.cs）。左邊任務名稱（照目前的排序），右邊日期軸（週末底色、今天一條線，天數照寬度）。
// 拖整條平移、拖兩端改預計開始或結束；沒有預計日期的任務在自己那列拉出一段就是設定起訖。
// 不在畫面範圍的任務在邊上標日期，點了跳過去。
import { Theme, Motion, ScrollView, Tip } from "@hb/index.slint";
import { TaskMenuArea } from "@hbc/index.slint";
import { TasksPageData, TkGanttRow } from "data.slint";
import { BarLook, ScheduleToolbar, BarMotion, DropFx } from "calendar.slint";

component GanttRowView {
    in property <TkGanttRow> item;
    in property <int> index;
    in property <length> name-width;
    in property <length> day-width;
    in property <int> days;
    property <length> edge: 7px;
    height: 28px;
    // 列底線
    Rectangle {
        y: parent.height - 1px;
        height: 1px;
        background: Theme.line;
        opacity: 0.6;
    }
    // 名稱
    Rectangle {
        x: 0;
        width: root.name-width;
        menu := TaskMenuArea {
            width: parent.width;
            height: parent.height;
            key: root.item.key;
        }
        name-ta := TouchArea {
            mouse-cursor: pointer;
            clicked => {
                TasksPageData.gantt-open(root.item.key);
            }
            pointer-event(e) => {
                if e.button == PointerEventButton.right && e.kind == PointerEventKind.down {
                    menu.open-at({ x: self.absolute-position.x + self.mouse-x, y: self.absolute-position.y + self.mouse-y });
                }
            }
            Tooltip {
                Tip {
                    text: root.item.name-tip;
                    max-bubble-width: 340px;
                }
            }
        }
        HorizontalLayout {
            padding-left: 4px;
            padding-right: 8px;
            opacity: root.item.done ? 0.55 : 1;
            Text {
                text: root.item.key + " ";
                color: Theme.muted;
                font-size: Theme.fs-sm;
                vertical-alignment: center;
            }
            Text {
                text: root.item.title;
                color: name-ta.has-hover ? Theme.accent-ink : Theme.ink;
                font-size: Theme.fs-sm;
                vertical-alignment: center;
                overflow: elide;
                horizontal-stretch: 1;
            }
        }
    }
    // 日期軸
    canvas := Rectangle {
        x: root.name-width;
        width: root.width - root.name-width;
        clip: true;
        if root.item.kind == 2: draw-ta := TouchArea {
            mouse-cursor: MouseCursor.crosshair;
            pointer-event(e) => {
                if e.button == PointerEventButton.left && e.kind == PointerEventKind.down {
                    TasksPageData.gantt-draw-start(root.index, clamp(floor(self.mouse-x / root.day-width), 0, root.days - 1));
                } else if e.button == PointerEventButton.left && e.kind == PointerEventKind.up {
                    TasksPageData.gantt-release(root.index);
                } else if e.kind == PointerEventKind.cancel {
                    TasksPageData.bar-cancel();
                }
            }
            moved => {
                if self.pressed {
                    TasksPageData.gantt-draw-move(root.index, clamp(floor(self.mouse-x / root.day-width), 0, root.days - 1));
                }
            }
            Tooltip {
                Tip {
                    text: "沒有預計日期：在這列拉出一段就是預計開始到結束";
                }
            }
        }
        if root.item.kind == 2 && root.item.preview: BarLook {
            x: root.item.start * root.day-width + 1px;
            y: 4px;
            width: max(root.day-width - 2px, (root.item.end + 1 - root.item.start) * root.day-width - 2px);
            height: root.height - 8px;
            bar: root.item.bar;
            opacity: 0.6;
        }
        if root.item.kind == 1: jump := Text {
            x: root.item.jump-before ? 4px : max(4px, parent.width - self.width - 4px);
            y: 6px;
            text: root.item.jump-text;
            color: root.item.jump-overdue ? Theme.error : jump-ta.has-hover ? Theme.ink : Theme.muted;
            font-size: 11px;
            jump-ta := TouchArea {
                mouse-cursor: pointer;
                clicked => {
                    TasksPageData.gantt-jump(root.index);
                }
                Tooltip {
                    Tip {
                        text: "跳到這個任務的日期";
                    }
                }
            }
        }
        if root.item.kind == 0: bar := Rectangle {
            property <bool> started;
            property <length> px;
            property <length> py;
            property <int> mode;
            x: root.item.start * root.day-width + 1px;
            y: 4px;
            width: max(root.day-width - 2px, (root.item.end + 1 - root.item.start) * root.day-width - 2px);
            height: root.height - 8px;
            // 拖拉時一天一天滑過去，不是跳過去
            animate x, width {
                duration: Theme.reduce-motion ? 0ms : 120ms;
                easing: Motion.out;
            }
            fx := BarMotion {
                key: root.item.key;
                index: root.index;
            }
            BarLook {
                x: 0;
                y: (1 - fx.settle) * -6px;
                width: parent.width * fx.grow;
                height: parent.height;
                opacity: (TasksPageData.drag-key == root.item.key ? 0.5 : root.item.bar.done ? 0.55 : 1) * fx.grow;
                bar: root.item.bar;
                dragging: TasksPageData.drag-key == root.item.key;
            }
            bar-ta := TouchArea {
                // 移到兩端提示可以拉
                mouse-cursor: self.mouse-x <= root.edge || self.mouse-x >= self.width - root.edge ? MouseCursor.ew-resize : MouseCursor.pointer;
                pointer-event(e) => {
                    if e.button == PointerEventButton.left && e.kind == PointerEventKind.down {
                        bar.started = false;
                        bar.px = self.absolute-position.x + self.mouse-x;
                        bar.py = self.absolute-position.y + self.mouse-y;
                        bar.mode = self.mouse-x <= root.edge ? 1 : self.mouse-x >= self.width - root.edge ? 2 : 0;
                    } else if e.button == PointerEventButton.left && e.kind == PointerEventKind.up {
                        if bar.started {
                            // 放開：落下回彈一下（重畫後新的那一條也會播）
                            DropFx.key = root.item.key;
                            fx.bounce();
                        }
                        bar.started = false;
                        TasksPageData.gantt-release(root.index);
                    } else if e.kind == PointerEventKind.cancel {
                        bar.started = false;
                        TasksPageData.bar-cancel();
                    } else if e.button == PointerEventButton.right && e.kind == PointerEventKind.down {
                        menu.open-at({ x: self.absolute-position.x + self.mouse-x, y: self.absolute-position.y + self.mouse-y });
                    }
                }
                moved => {
                    if !self.pressed {
                        return;
                    }
                    let ax = self.absolute-position.x + self.mouse-x;
                    let ay = self.absolute-position.y + self.mouse-y;
                    if !bar.started && (abs(ax - bar.px) > 4px || abs(ay - bar.py) > 4px) {
                        bar.started = true;
                    }
                    if bar.started {
                        TasksPageData.gantt-drag(root.index, bar.mode, round((ax - bar.px) / root.day-width));
                    }
                }
                Tooltip {
                    Tip {
                        text: root.item.bar.tip;
                        max-bubble-width: 320px;
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}

export component GanttView {
    property <length> name-width: 240px;
    property <length> bar-margin: 22px;
    property <length> dw: TasksPageData.gantt-day-width;
    changed width => {
        TasksPageData.gantt-resized(self.width);
    }
    init => {
        TasksPageData.gantt-resized(self.width);
    }
    // 放開的回彈播完就清掉，之後的重畫不再播
    Timer {
        interval: 1500ms;
        running: DropFx.key != "";
        triggered => {
            DropFx.key = "";
        }
    }
    VerticalLayout {
        ScheduleToolbar { }
        // 日期標題：月份（每月第一天或最左邊）、日期與星期
        Rectangle {
            height: 38px;
            Text {
                x: 4px;
                y: parent.height - self.height - 5px;
                text: "任務";
                color: Theme.muted;
                font-size: Theme.fs-sm;
                font-weight: 600;
            }
            Rectangle {
                x: root.name-width;
                width: parent.width - root.name-width - root.bar-margin;
                clip: true;
                for d[i] in TasksPageData.gantt-header: Rectangle {
                    x: i * root.dw;
                    width: root.dw;
                    if d.month != "": Text {
                        x: 2px;
                        y: 0;
                        text: d.month;
                        color: Theme.muted;
                        font-family: Theme.font-num;
                        font-size: 11px;
                        font-weight: 600;
                    }
                    Rectangle {
                        y: 14px;
                        height: 22px;
                        border-radius: 6px;
                        background: d.today ? Theme.accent-soft : transparent;
                        VerticalLayout {
                            Text {
                                text: d.day;
                                color: d.today ? Theme.accent-ink : d.weekend ? Theme.faint : Theme.muted;
                                font-family: Theme.font-num;
                                font-size: 10px;
                                font-weight: d.today ? 700 : 500;
                                horizontal-alignment: center;
                            }
                            Text {
                                text: d.weekday;
                                color: d.today ? Theme.accent-ink : d.weekend ? Theme.faint : Theme.muted;
                                font-size: 9.5px;
                                font-weight: d.today ? 700 : 400;
                                horizontal-alignment: center;
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
            Rectangle {
                y: parent.height - 1px;
                height: 1px;
                background: Theme.line;
            }
        }
        sv := ScrollView {
            overlay-bar: false;
            content-height: max(self.visible-height, TasksPageData.gantt-rows.length * 28px + 6px);
            content-width: self.visible-width;
            // 週末底色、今天一條線：整欄畫一次（每列各畫一次太重）
            Rectangle {
                x: root.name-width;
                y: 0;
                width: sv.visible-width - root.name-width;
                height: sv.content-height;
                clip: true;
                for d[i] in TasksPageData.gantt-header: Rectangle {
                    x: i * root.dw;
                    width: root.dw;
                    background: d.weekend ? Theme.fill : transparent;
                }
                if TasksPageData.gantt-today >= 0: Rectangle {
                    x: (TasksPageData.gantt-today + 0.5) * root.dw - 1px;
                    width: 2px;
                    background: Theme.accent;
                    opacity: 0.7;
                }
            }
            for r[i] in TasksPageData.gantt-rows: GanttRowView {
                y: i * 28px;
                width: sv.visible-width;
                item: r;
                index: i;
                name-width: root.name-width;
                day-width: root.dw;
                days: TasksPageData.gantt-days;
            }
        }
    }
}
